# LiveKit Unity SDK 适配规则

> **配套参考**
> - `.cursor/skills/client-sdk-unity/SKILL.md` — LiveKit Unity SDK 能力面（Room / Track / RPC / DataChannel / 生命周期）
> - `.cursor/skills/livekit-unity-video-publish/IMPL_REF.md` — Unity 推流接缝 + 12 条踩坑表（PublishTrack NRE / TrackSource / 黑帧 / 重连污染等更详尽现场）
> - `.cursor/memory/architecture/sprint4_livekit_stability_and_video_strategy.md` — Sprint4 前置：LiveKit Bus 稳定性与视频上限策略
>
